# 詞: 銀包

1. 我唔見咗個銀包，入面有好多重要嘅證件。 (I lost my wallet, and there are many important documents inside.)

2. 佢成日都唔帶銀包出街，淨係用手機俾錢。 (He often goes out without his wallet, only using his phone to pay.)

3. 阿媽送咗個新銀包俾我，係真皮嚟㗎。 (My mother gave me a new wallet, and it's made of real leather.)

4. 你個銀包咁脹，入面裝咗啲乜嘢嚟㗎？ (Your wallet is so bulging, what do you have inside?)

5. 我喺巴士上面執到個銀包，已經交咗去失物認領處。 (I found a wallet on the bus and have already handed it to the lost and found office.)

6. 佢打開個銀包，發現入面得一張一百蚊紙。 (He opened his wallet and found only a one-hundred-dollar bill inside.)

7. 呢個銀包係我女朋友送嘅生日禮物，我好鍾意。 (This wallet is a birthday gift from my girlfriend, and I really like it.)

8. 小心啲啦，銀包放喺褲後袋好易俾人偷㗎。 (Be careful, putting your wallet in your back pocket makes it easy to be stolen.)

9. 我個銀包用咗五年，邊位都磨損晒喇。 (I've used my wallet for five years, and the edges are all worn out.)

10. 佢成日都話要慳錢，但係銀包入面總係有好多現金。 (He always says he wants to save money, but there's always a lot of cash in his wallet.) [end of text]


